Flag artwork from flag-icons (https://github.com/lipis/flag-icons), MIT License.
Copyright (c) 2013 Panayiotis Lipiridis.
These files are the 4x3 SVGs, embedded so the language list does not depend on a
font that can draw flag emoji. Windows does not render those emoji.

eo.svg is not from that set (flag-icons does not ship Esperanto). It is an original
drawing of the Esperanto flag: green field, white canton, green star.
